# reflex-site local configuration — the template for `.env`.
#
# Copy:  cp .env.example .env   then fill in values.
# NEVER commit `.env`. ⚠ This repo's .gitignore does NOT list `.env` yet, and
# wrangler.toml serves the repo ROOT as static assets (`directory = "./"`)
# while .assetsignore does not exclude `.env*` — so a root `.env` would be
# both committable AND publicly served. Add `.env` to .gitignore and `.env*`
# to .assetsignore before creating one.
#
# This repo reads NO secrets and NO required config. The site is static
# (zero bindings, zero Worker secrets). `npx wrangler deploy` authenticates
# through your own wrangler login / CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN — nothing here.
# (If you export CF tokens for that deploy: wrangler treats CF_API_TOKEN as a
# DEPRECATED ALIAS of CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN — unset it with
# `env -u CF_API_TOKEN` so a wrongly-scoped value cannot shadow the deploy token.)
#
# Every variable below is an OPTIONAL override for a script or test.

# ── Sibling checkouts (default: beside this repo, ../<name>) ───────────────
# Used by: scripts/sync_mirror.py, scripts/render_flows.py,
#   scripts/build_flow_walks.py, scripts/republish_bench.sh.
# RIIR_REFLEX_CHECKOUT=../riir-reflex
# INSTINCT_CHECKOUT=../riir-instinct
# RETHINK_CHECKOUT=../riir-rethink
# REFLEXER_CHECKOUT=../riir-reflexer
# KATGPT_RS_CHECKOUT=../katgpt-rs

# ── Bench publishing acknowledgements (scripts/publish_bench.py) ───────────
# Each is an explicit, per-run acknowledgement of a destructive or unusual
# publish — set it on the command line for that one run, not in .env.
# PUBLISH_BENCH_FULL_REPLACE=1                 allow a wholesale replace that drops lane slots
# PUBLISH_BENCH_LANES=paw,paw_local            restrict the extra lanes published
# PUBLISH_BENCH_ALLOW_UNQUOTABLE=<host>[,..]   ack an unquotable host row
# PUBLISH_BENCH_POPULATION_RESET=<suite>[,..]  ack a suite population reset
# PUBLISH_BENCH_CORPUS_RESET=<suite>[,..]      ack a suite corpus-digest reset
# PUBLISH_ALLOW_SAMPLE_MISMATCH=<suite>[,..]   ack a cross-sample lane pair (scripts/check_lane_pairing.py)

# ── Smokes, demo recording, gates ──────────────────────────────────────────
# REFLEX_ENGINE=http://127.0.0.1:7331   engine URL for scripts/arena_protocol_check.mjs
# LEGIBILITY_PORT=18933                 scripts/arena_legibility_smoke.mjs
# LAYA_PYTHON=python3                   scripts/record_demo_walks.mjs oracle interpreter
# LAYA_PY_DEVICE=mps                    its device
# ALLOW_CPU_LAYA=1                      allow publishing a non-metal tetris walk on macOS
# IMAGE_GATE_WARN_KB=300                scripts/image_gate.sh soft threshold
# IMAGE_GATE_MAX_KB=1024                scripts/image_gate.sh hard threshold
# IMAGE_GATE_ALLOW=                     comma-separated non-WebP exception substrings
# TETRIS_FIXTURE_DIR= FLAPPY_FIXTURE= LANES_FIXTURE=   golden-test fixture overrides (assets/games/*.test.mjs)
